⚡️🇺🇸🇨🇳 US Secretary of War Pete Hegseth, continuing the Republican tradition of getting mad at a thing they made up, has decided to declare the Confucius Institute a threat to national security. 

The Confucius institute, while functionally a foreign-funded program, is a benign entity. It’s a pretty standard cultural exchange program similar to other university initiatives such as France’s Alliance Française, Germany’s Goethe Institute, or the U.K.’s British Council. Hegseth is grasping at straws because he’s likely about to get fired.

